## The three stages (never conflate)


| Stage | How reached |
|---|---|
| **eval** | bought a challenge, trying to pass it |
| **funded** | passed the eval. A pass ALWAYS lands here. |
| **live** | firm moved to real capital. Needs 5+ payouts AND firm's decision. Never automatic. |

`lifecycle` is the single source of truth. Never infer from `phase1_completed`, `status`, or `live_account`.

## Batch purchases


When buying N accounts, send ONE `buy-eval` call with `accounts: [{ last4: "0048" }, { last4: "0049" }, ...]`. Never loop N separate calls — the unique index on `(user_id, upper(account_first4), account_number_last4) WHERE status='active'` blocks the 2nd insert with the same last4.

