### Bot logging for copy-trade groups

**Log EACH account separately.** Different firms have different fills and fees, so amounts may differ per account. Do NOT sum amounts into one trade. Bot guide §12 documents this. The `link-copy-trade` / `unlink-copy-trade` API is for managing group membership, NOT for logging trades — use `log-trade` per account ref.

